{"id":"coragem","lemma":"coragem","pos":"noun","rank":896,"glosses":["courage; boldness; guts (the quality of not being scared easily)","courage; audacity; insolence (the quality of being insolent)"],"ipa":"/kuˈɾa.ʒɐ̃j̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3a/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-coragem.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-coragem.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"coragens"},"examples":[{"text":"Ele tem coragem.","en":"He has guts.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1273951","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},null]},{"text":"Tom tem muita coragem.","en":"Tom has a lot of courage.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"has / there is","l":"ter"},{"g":"very, a lot","l":"muito"},null]},{"text":"O que lhe falta é coragem.","en":"What he lacks is courage.","words":[null,null,{"g":"(to) him / her"},{"g":"lack"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"what"]]},{"text":"Não tenho coragem de dizer não.","en":"I don't have the guts to say no.","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"have","l":"ter"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to speak"},{"g":"not / no"}]},{"text":"Ela teve coragem de falar.","en":"She had the nerve to speak out.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to speak"}]}]}